{"baseRefName":"codex/parallax-surface-orientation","body":"## Purpose\n\nComplete the SC-00B Spatial Inspector refit on the combined Parallax root source. The draft preserves SC-01 Scene Manager, SC-00 room/group selection, SC-02 typed elements, and canonical authoring paths. It adds the Property and Capability Preservation Matrix, Guided/Standard/Engineering depth, a functional contextual rail, room recovery, and Creator Library journeys.\n\n## Current exact-source review packet\n\n- Product source `6bea21300369db4598d0e746b63f2f5cfcebc517` includes SC-02 base `25affc5a6381a26497fb4a682c3cfd96edeff8fa`. Seven isolated production Chromium journeys passed with source binding and task-owned cleanup. The packet has 70 rendered screenshots, three observation inventories, nine hash-checked recordings, selection contexts in each depth, keyboard rail, resizing/scrolling, light theme, reduced motion, and desktop/phone Library return.\n- Point light and spatial audio show Move without ineffective Rotate or Resize in Guided; Standard omits their empty shape section. Engineering labels canonical width/scale as **Placement footprint** for fit and snapping while typed fields set output reach. Spot direction and rendered geometry retain applicable controls. Engineering XYZ commits a finite coordinate on blur or Enter, adding one Undo step and preserving other axes; blank input is discarded.\n- A separate Assistant preview journey passed on the same source. Eleven screenshots and one checked recording show an unapplied proposal in all three depths, Review and Apply, renderer confirmation, and saved restore.\n- Eight local SC-00B semantic contexts passed on the same source and PR base: two Creator journeys on desktop and phone with normal and reduced motion. The packet retains 28 SHA-checked screenshots and eight recordings; maximum measured feedback was 191 ms against a 3000 ms contract budget. No context reported document overflow or a serious/critical axe finding.\n- An independent local reviewer verified the exact tree and lockfile, all 73 combined capture hashes and nine recording hashes, and inspected Point, audio, Spot, Ambient, Scene, room, phone and rail captures. No Inspector or rail blocker was found. A minor left Scene graph row peeks above its sticky heading in two Guided room captures without obscuring the Inspector.\n- [Review and current captures](https://github.com/Kgray44/treasurehuntSoT/blob/codex/parallax-sc00b-integration-probe/Development_Docs/Projects/Project_Parallax/SC00B_Combined_Inspector_Review_20261015.md#current-contextual-source-review) and [capability matrix](https://github.com/Kgray44/treasurehuntSoT/blob/codex/parallax-sc00b-integration-probe/Development_Docs/Projects/Project_Parallax/SC00B_Property_Capability_Matrix.md) hold the source-bound record and before/after reconciliation.\n\n## Validation and boundary\n\nTypeScript, ESLint for changed source and journey, the focused 26-test component set, `npm run docs:validate`, `npm run experience:test` (44/44), `npm run features:sync`, and `npm run features:validate` passed. The owner answered “Looks good” to the current `6bea2130` visual/usability packet on 2026-10-15, after accepting the earlier `6d3d2024` and `79348a8f` packets. No Feature Catalog fragment changed while this branch remains under review.\n\nThis PR remains a draft. Against refreshed protected main `670706e875eeac61031f08f69595db2dc9a81879`, full-plan preparation stops at inherited `PRODUCT_EXPERIENCE_EXPERIENCE_DESIGN_REQUIRED:crossdeck.phase2.continuity:Crossdeck and Parallax experience integration`. An isolated main-descendant merge probe confirmed the gate still applies after resolving its sole `.gitattributes` conflict and retaining current-main Crossdeck pairing files; the shared source impact graph reaches Crossdeck display and handoff. The local semantic diagnostic records `trustedCapture: false`, formal `independentReview: false`, and `ownerAcceptance: NOT_CLAIMED`; the separate local reviewer and owner visual/usability approval do not change those workflow fields. Protected full-plan capture, Sounding Line qualification, and protected-main integration remain open. Hold a conflicting protected merge during Crossdeck's active capture-to-ordinary window.\n","commits":[{"authoredDate":"2026-10-15T10:15:10Z","authors":[{"email":"kkidsgray@icloud.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MzczMDEx","login":"Kgray44","name":"Kgray44"}],"committedDate":"2026-10-15T11:16:43Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"test(parallax): stage SC-00B acceptance packet on SC-01 integration","oid":"be7330574513351635cdc247483b1238cc2e20b0"},{"authoredDate":"2026-10-15T10:40:51Z","authors":[{"email":"kkidsgray@icloud.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MzczMDEx","login":"Kgray44","name":"Kgray44"}],"committedDate":"2026-10-15T11:16:45Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"docs(parallax): retain combined SC-01 Inspector browser review","oid":"3b3d6a36fc8a12fe74117642d7a7b82407c5bfde"},{"authoredDate":"2026-10-15T10:50:13Z","authors":[{"email":"kkidsgray@icloud.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MzczMDEx","login":"Kgray44","name":"Kgray44"}],"committedDate":"2026-10-15T11:16:45Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"docs(parallax): retain combined Inspector semantic replay","oid":"2aa6f543734225410aac45817dfbd58a7a4a4ff8"},{"authoredDate":"2026-10-15T10:52:21Z","authors":[{"email":"kkidsgray@icloud.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MzczMDEx","login":"Kgray44","name":"Kgray44"}],"committedDate":"2026-10-15T11:16:46Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"docs(parallax): index rebased Inspector evidence","oid":"e001f68875888b825382c7a13b4770bc2a8b6d14"},{"authoredDate":"2026-10-15T11:01:59Z","authors":[{"email":"kkidsgray@icloud.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MzczMDEx","login":"Kgray44","name":"Kgray44"}],"committedDate":"2026-10-15T11:16:46Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"docs(parallax): retain root-based Inspector browser and semantic proof","oid":"86e568035d0f4ac532607754590542a7c59e15db"},{"authoredDate":"2026-10-15T11:06:14Z",